{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That morning, I took my hand cannon and ventured into the worm caves for food\u2014or at least, so I told the others. The real reason lay somewhere between boredom and restlessness, which made me turn to things that I was good at.<br><br>I was damned good at hunting worms.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/laser.gif?t=1740674688\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Jack &amp; AmI, two unique characters with 40 unique skills for each.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/levelgif.gif?t=1740674688\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the puzzle of Slither as you explore the caveback of District 4 in its unique blight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/slithergif.gif?t=1740674688\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the complex but intuitive tactical RPG combat and plan your actions thoroughly in accordance with your playstyle<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/extras/swordgif.gif?t=1740674688\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194740?t=1740674688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3194740?t=1740674688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/09c83d1113f0291c4b2ecfd14aaf555c673db0bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740674688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194740/09c83d1113f0291c4b2ecfd14aaf555c673db0bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740674688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":